WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:10.200
Health Canada's annual report indicated that by the end of 2023, the number of MAID deaths reached 13,241 in a single year.

00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:21.887
At this stage, state-administered euthanasia accounted for 4.7 percent of all deaths nationwide, statistically surpassing suicide as a leading cause of mortality in Canada.
